@startuml 03_state_machine_mission
title MARS-OPS - State Machine Diagram (Mission lifecycle)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> CREATED : new Mission()

CREATED --> ASSIGNED : submitMission() / validation and\nresource check pass -> assign()
CREATED --> FAILED : submitMission() / validation or\nresource check fails -> fail(reason)

ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : processTimeUnit() / start()
ASSIGNED --> FAILED : checkOngoing() problem\n(e.g. dust storm) -> fail(reason)

IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : advance() [timepassed < duration]
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : advance() [timepassed >= duration]
IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : checkOngoing() problem -> fail(reason)

COMPLETED --> [*] : release() agents
FAILED --> [*] : release() agents
@enduml
